# .claude/ is a process/dev-workflow directory (agent memory, RFC drafts,
# session logs). Two-line pattern: first ignore everything under it, then
# unignore the .claude/rfcs/ subtree (the exception) as the versioned
# design-decision record. `.claude/` alone (trailing-slash form) makes
# every path inside untrackable — including negated exceptions — because
# git skips the whole subtree. Use `.claude/*` + a re-include of `rfcs/`
# so the negation for individual files under it actually applies.
.claude/*
!.claude/rfcs/
!.claude/rfcs/**
.DS_Store

# Non-public draft docs and internal patch notes.
docs/ai-guide/patches/

.env
.env.local
.idea/
.scratch/
.smix/
.smix/runner/
.smix/trace/
.vitest
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
*.xcuserstate
**/xcuserdata/
# dhat heap profile output (manually-generated via examples/dhat_profile.rs)
# JetBrains
# Session / scratch artifacts (never commit)
# Swift / Xcode build products (user committed xcodeproj per release decision)
# Build artifact ignores
android-runner/.gradle/
android-runner/.kotlin/
android-runner/app/.cxx/
android-runner/app/build/
android-runner/build/
android-runner/local.properties
coverage
dhat-heap.json
dist
examples/_scratch/
node_modules
swift-bridge/.build/
swift-bridge/build/
target/
# Root SwiftPM build artifacts
.build/
.swiftpm/
docs/ai-guide/insight-*.md
docs/ai-guide/gol-611-*.md
docs/ai-guide/patches/
